data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `evidence-package-generation` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/evidence-package-generation/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-package-generation\npython /mnt/skills/custom/ffmpeg-utils/scripts/run.py --operation keyframe --input-path /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --timestamp 1 --output-path /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-package-generation/source.jpg --output /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-package-generation/keyframe_result.json\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nevent = {\"event_id\":\"EVT_PACKAGE_001\",\"video_id\":\"video-traffic-agent-test\",\"camera_id\":\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\"event_type\":\"manual_evidence\",\"event_time\":\"2026-05-20T10:00:01+08:00\",\"event_elapsed_seconds\":1,\"image_uri\":\"/mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-package-generation/source.jpg\",\"raw_segment_uri\":\"/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4\",\"evidence_frame_ids\":[\"frame_001\"]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-package-generation/event.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(event, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/evidence-package-generation/scripts/run.py --event-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-package-generation/event.json --output-dir /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation/package --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"3a6fbac3-b02e-46ee-9e2f-6927136c3198"},{"content":"我将按照您的要求严格执行测试流程。\n\n## 第一步：读取 SKILL.md 文件\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":120,"prompt_tokens":9638,"total_tokens":9758,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":36,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":120},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9638}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-754f7c37-413a-9a10-af89-16cebe9316ac","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e637f-b0ca-7bf1-9a14-d0f3eea07e53-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 evidence-package-generation skill 的 SKILL.md 文件","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/evidence-package-generation/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_fcf9e955b1e3403caf553380","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9638,"output_tokens":120,"total_tokens":9758,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":36}}},{"content":"---\nname: evidence-package-generation\ndescription: Generate an evidence package manifest for indexed monitoring videos or event/search results, including snapshot evidence and optional short video clips. Use when Codex needs a package_id, manifest URI, evidence items, hashes, and reusable evidence artifacts.\n---\n\n# Evidence Package Generation\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nUse `--event-json` when the user provides an event. Use `--search-result-json` when the user wants evidence for search hits. Use `--video-id` to retrieve a source video document from Elasticsearch.\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\n```bash\npython evidence-package-generation/scripts/run.py --video-id <video_id> --event-json <event.json> --output-dir <package_dir> --index citybrain-video-library --config <config.json> --output <result.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--input`, `--index`, `--video-id`, `--event-json`, `--search-result-json`, `--output-dir`, `--pre-seconds`, `--post-seconds`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Resolve package items from event JSON, search results, or Elasticsearch video id lookup.\n2. Generate snapshot evidence when event frames are available.\n3. Generate a short clip when source video and event timing are available.\n4. Write a package manifest JSON containing evidence artifacts and integrity hashes.\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `package_id`, `manifest_uri`, `items`, and `evidence`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `MISSING_INPUT`\n- `ES_CONNECTION_FAILED`\n- `ES_REQUEST_FAILED`\n- Nested evidence generation failures are included per item.\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not decide whether an event occurred and do not modify event confidence. This skill packages already available video/event evidence.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"ddefcc9c-6af3-45af-9dee-ac6a0159b582","tool_call_id":"call_fcf9e955b1e3403caf553380","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"## 第二步：执行 bash 命令\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":401,"prompt_tokens":10143,"total_tokens":10544,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":401},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10143}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-44641dc4-7482-91c4-883e-6ca010f673b3","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e637f-da71-7112-8d6a-fe0336c24db1-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 evidence-package-genera